    "paragraphs": [
      "I am a Ph.D. candidate in Computer Science at National Tsing Hua University, advised by Prof. Chun-Yao Wang and Prof. Bei Yu (CUHK). I received an M.S. in Computer Science from National Tsing Hua University in 2023 and a B.S. in Computer Science and Information Engineering from Ming Chuan University in 2021.",
      "My research focuses on LLMs for EDA, particularly algorithm discovery and design-adaptive optimization. Building on my work in RTL recovery, logic synthesis, and physical design, I explore LLM-guided optimization across the circuit design flow.",
      "I have received more than ten awards in international EDA contests, including three first-place awards in the ICCAD CAD Contest and CADathlon. I am also a recipient of the Synopsys – Prof. Chung Laung Liu Ph.D. Scholarship."
